  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">안녕하세요 선생님! 1단원 수행평가 공유합니다.<br>&#160;<br>&lt;전체 과정&gt;<br>수행평가 이전 차시: <a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2015\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2015</a> 합니다!<br>&#160;<br>1차시: 주제 선정(동기 포함) + 가설 생성<br>&#160;<br>2차시: 가설 정교화(측정가능한 변인) + 탐구계획서 작성<br>&#160;<br>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>&#160;<br>&lt;자료 공유&gt;<br>1. 활동지: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f4cwpdHZ1fnf_4Hm-s7vpgAWWDbLY4AbYUj0OxaCKIU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f4cwpdHZ1fnf_4Hm-s7vpgAWWDbLY4AbYUj0OxaCKIU/edit?usp=sharing</a><br>(사본만들기 쓰시면 됩니다!)</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"(수행평가1) 가설 생성 및 탐구 실험 계획(학생 작성용)_공유\" data-og-description=\"광수중학교 가설 생성 및 탐구 실험 계획 수행평가 과학1 with 영재(지묘)T 탐구주제 선정하기 (5점) 내가 고른 탐구주제 이 탐구 주제를 고른 이유 설명하기 탐구가설 생성하기 (10점) 가설 세우기 \" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f4cwpdHZ1fnf_4Hm-s7vpgAWWDbLY4AbYUj0OxaCKIU/edit?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f4cwpdHZ1fnf_4Hm-s7vpgAWWDbLY4AbYUj0OxaCKIU/edit?usp=sharing&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dxK1Cu/hyYFCZ2MNy/7ps7bFbq0aD80Z0eaCfh7K/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f4cwpdHZ1fnf_4Hm-s7vpgAWWDbLY4AbYUj0OxaCKIU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f4cwpdHZ1fnf_4Hm-s7vpgAWWDbLY4AbYUj0OxaCKIU/edit?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dxK1Cu/hyYFCZ2MNy/7ps7bFbq0aD80Z0eaCfh7K/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">(수행평가1) 가설 생성 및 탐구 실험 계획(학생 작성용)_공유</p><p class=\"og-desc\">광수중학교 가설 생성 및 탐구 실험 계획 수행평가 과학1 with 영재(지묘)T 탐구주제 선정하기 (5점) 내가 고른 탐구주제 이 탐구 주제를 고른 이유 설명하기 탐구가설 생성하기 (10점) 가설 세우기 </p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">2. MIZOU(가설검토 체험): <a href=\"https://mizou.com/login-thread?ID=u-_xQRHgWkzQHjGswGB02lQBzCNZaZvoymkkylLNnSM-71910\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://mizou.com/login-thread?ID=u-_xQRHgWkzQHjGswGB02lQBzCNZaZvoymkkylLNnSM-71910</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Session - 가설 개선 도우미\" data-og-description=\"학생들이 제안한 가설을 검토하고, 조건에 맞게 수정할 수 있도록 조언을 제공합니다. 학생이 스스로의 가설을 발전시킬 수 있게 돕습니다.\" data-og-host=\"mizou.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://mizou.com/login-thread?ID=u-_xQRHgWkzQHjGswGB02lQBzCNZaZvoymkkylLNnSM-71910\" data-og-url=\"https://mizou.com/login-thread?ID=u-_xQRHgWkzQHjGswGB02lQBzCNZaZvoymkkylLNnSM-71910\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/pzYiq/hyYFBNBiiK/rIb1nfuRPa0ox3NVKgQgdk/img.jpg?width=400&amp;height=400&amp;face=0_0_400_400\"><a href=\"https://mizou.com/login-thread?ID=u-_xQRHgWkzQHjGswGB02lQBzCNZaZvoymkkylLNnSM-71910\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://mizou.com/login-thread?ID=u-_xQRHgWkzQHjGswGB02lQBzCNZaZvoymkkylLNnSM-71910\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/pzYiq/hyYFBNBiiK/rIb1nfuRPa0ox3NVKgQgdk/img.jpg?width=400&amp;height=400&amp;face=0_0_400_400\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Session - 가설 개선 도우미</p><p class=\"og-desc\">학생들이 제안한 가설을 검토하고, 조건에 맞게 수정할 수 있도록 조언을 제공합니다. 학생이 스스로의 가설을 발전시킬 수 있게 돕습니다.</p><p class=\"og-host\">mizou.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160; &#160;3. MIZOU스크립트(요섭T 공유해주신 가설검토ChatGPT 저한테 맞게 수정!)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/523250b378a12ef054ef0914f32b609700e7e4a0?download\" data-file-name=\"#MIZOU스크립트.txt\" data-file-size=\"4104\" data-mimetype=\"text/plain\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D29%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20250418210216&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F523250b378a12ef054ef0914f32b609700e7e4a0')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">#MIZOU스크립트</span><span class=\"type\">.txt</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.01KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">4. 채점기준 및 안내자료&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/12a040559445a8040b59a49f3d81c500e5eb0d16?download\" data-file-name=\"#가설 생성 및 탐구실험 계획(채점기준).hwp\" data-file-size=\"124928\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D29%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20250418210216&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F12a040559445a8040b59a49f3d81c500e5eb0d16')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">#가설 생성 및 탐구실험 계획(채점기준)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">122.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30f19c30b668919d91fb9c0b155f611518094a28?download\" data-file-name=\"#안내자료(이전차시 활동지 짜집기).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"709075\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df